<title>USA: Scudder says in fund pact with Merrill.</title>
<headline>Scudder says in fund pact with Merrill.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scudder, Stevens &amp; Clark Inc said it reached an agreement with Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc that will allow Merrill's clients access to Scudder's family of no-load funds.</p>
<p>Scudder said Merrill will make the funds available through the firm's Private Client Group through a variety of marketing programs.</p>
<p>The programs will allow Merrill clients to pay an account-based fee rather than transaction charges or commissions, Scudder said.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
